<mxfile host="app.diagrams.net">
  <diagram name="Page-1" id="uxnFHa--FM-wT5edHDut">
    <mxGraphModel dx="1030" dy="658" grid="1" gridSize="10" guides="1" tooltips="1" connect="1" arrows="1" fold="1" page="1" pageScale="1" pageWidth="827" pageHeight="1169" math="0" shadow="0">
      <root>
        <mxCell id="0" />
        <mxCell id="1" parent="0" />
        <UserObject label="" mermaidData="{&#xa;  &quot;data&quot;: &quot;sequenceDiagram\n    autonumber\n\n    actor Customer\n    actor Analyst as Analyst / Reviewer\n\n    participant Portal as Customer / Analyst Portal\n    participant Edge as Cloudflare Edge\n    participant API as Application API\n    participant CaseSvc as Case Management Service\n    participant LG as LangGraph Orchestrator\n\n    participant Classifier as Classification Agent\n    participant TxAgent as Transaction Agent\n    participant EvidenceAgent as Evidence Agent\n    participant PolicyAgent as Policy Agent\n    participant ValidationAgent as Validation Agent\n    participant RiskAgent as Risk Agent\n    participant RecAgent as Recommendation Agent\n    participant CommAgent as Communication Agent\n\n    participant Banking as Mock Banking Services\n    participant RAG as Policy RAG / pgvector\n    participant Rules as Deterministic Rules Engine\n    participant DB as PostgreSQL\n    participant Audit as Audit Service\n    participant Notify as Notification Service\n\n    Customer-&gt;&gt;Portal: Create dispute + upload evidence\n    Portal-&gt;&gt;Edge: Submit dispute request\n    Edge-&gt;&gt;Edge: Authenticate / Authorize / WAF / Rate Limit\n    Edge-&gt;&gt;API: Forward validated request\n\n    API-&gt;&gt;CaseSvc: Create dispute case\n    CaseSvc-&gt;&gt;DB: Persist case + evidence metadata\n    CaseSvc-&gt;&gt;Audit: Record case creation\n    CaseSvc--&gt;&gt;API: case_id\n    API--&gt;&gt;Portal: Dispute created\n\n    Portal-&gt;&gt;API: Submit case for investigation\n    API-&gt;&gt;LG: Start workflow(case_id)\n\n    Note over LG: Intake &amp; Validation\n\n    LG-&gt;&gt;DB: Load case state\n    LG-&gt;&gt;Audit: Record workflow start\n\n    Note over LG,Classifier: Step 1 - Classification\n\n    LG-&gt;&gt;Classifier: Classify dispute\n    Classifier--&gt;&gt;LG: dispute_type + confidence\n\n    alt Unsupported dispute category\n        LG-&gt;&gt;Audit: Record unsupported category\n        LG--&gt;&gt;API: Route to manual processing\n        API--&gt;&gt;Portal: Manual review required\n    else Supported category\n\n        Note over LG,TxAgent: Step 2 - Retrieve authoritative transaction data\n\n        LG-&gt;&gt;TxAgent: Retrieve transaction evidence\n        TxAgent-&gt;&gt;Banking: Customer / Account / Transaction lookup\n        Banking--&gt;&gt;TxAgent: Transaction details\n\n        TxAgent-&gt;&gt;Banking: Settlement / Merchant / Refund lookup\n        Banking--&gt;&gt;TxAgent: Related transaction events\n\n        TxAgent--&gt;&gt;LG: Normalized evidence bundle\n        LG-&gt;&gt;Audit: Record tool calls + results\n\n        Note over LG,EvidenceAgent: Step 3 - Evidence completeness\n\n        LG-&gt;&gt;EvidenceAgent: Build evidence checklist\n        EvidenceAgent--&gt;&gt;LG: Required / available / missing evidence\n\n        alt Mandatory evidence missing\n            LG-&gt;&gt;DB: Save checkpoint\n            LG-&gt;&gt;Audit: Record missing evidence\n            LG--&gt;&gt;API: Request additional evidence\n            API--&gt;&gt;Portal: Evidence required\n            Customer-&gt;&gt;Portal: Upload missing evidence\n            Portal-&gt;&gt;API: Submit additional evidence\n            API-&gt;&gt;CaseSvc: Store evidence\n            CaseSvc-&gt;&gt;DB: Persist evidence\n            API-&gt;&gt;LG: Resume workflow\n        end\n\n        Note over LG,PolicyAgent: Step 4 - Policy-grounded RAG\n\n        LG-&gt;&gt;PolicyAgent: Retrieve applicable policy\n        PolicyAgent-&gt;&gt;RAG: Search by dispute type, channel, date, product\n        RAG--&gt;&gt;PolicyAgent: Ranked policy passages + citations\n        PolicyAgent--&gt;&gt;LG: Applicable policy + citations + confidence\n\n        alt Retrieval confidence too low\n            LG-&gt;&gt;DB: Save checkpoint\n            LG-&gt;&gt;Audit: Record low RAG confidence\n            LG--&gt;&gt;API: Escalate for policy review\n            API--&gt;&gt;Analyst: Manual policy selection required\n            Analyst-&gt;&gt;Portal: Select / confirm applicable policy\n            Portal-&gt;&gt;API: Submit reviewer input\n            API-&gt;&gt;LG: Resume workflow\n        end\n\n        Note over LG,ValidationAgent: Step 5 - Deterministic rule validation\n\n        LG-&gt;&gt;ValidationAgent: Validate evidence + policy conditions\n        ValidationAgent-&gt;&gt;Rules: Execute eligibility / timeline rules\n        Rules--&gt;&gt;ValidationAgent: Rule outcomes\n        ValidationAgent--&gt;&gt;LG: Validation results\n        LG-&gt;&gt;Audit: Record deterministic rule results\n\n        Note over LG,RiskAgent: Step 6 - Risk &amp; confidence assessment\n\n        LG-&gt;&gt;RiskAgent: Assess uncertainty and risk indicators\n        RiskAgent--&gt;&gt;LG: Risk flags + confidence score\n\n        alt Confidence below threshold\n            LG-&gt;&gt;DB: Save checkpoint\n            LG-&gt;&gt;Audit: Record low-confidence escalation\n            LG--&gt;&gt;API: Escalate to supervisor\n            API--&gt;&gt;Analyst: Supervisor review required\n        else Confidence acceptable\n\n            Note over LG,RecAgent: Step 7 - Generate recommendation\n\n            LG-&gt;&gt;RecAgent: Generate evidence-backed recommendation\n            RecAgent--&gt;&gt;LG: Recommendation + rationale + citations\n\n            LG-&gt;&gt;Audit: Record model / prompt / policy versions\n\n            Note over LG,Analyst: Step 8 - Human-in-the-loop approval\n\n            LG-&gt;&gt;DB: Save human-review checkpoint\n            LG--&gt;&gt;API: Create review task\n            API--&gt;&gt;Analyst: Display evidence + rules + citations + recommendation\n\n            Analyst-&gt;&gt;Portal: Approve / Modify / Reject / Request Rework\n            Portal-&gt;&gt;API: Submit decision + rationale\n            API-&gt;&gt;LG: Resume workflow with human decision\n\n            LG-&gt;&gt;Audit: Record reviewer identity + decision + timestamp\n\n            alt Request Rework\n                LG-&gt;&gt;RecAgent: Regenerate using reviewer feedback\n                RecAgent--&gt;&gt;LG: Revised recommendation\n                LG--&gt;&gt;API: Create updated review task\n            else Approved or Modified\n                Note over LG,CommAgent: Step 9 - Customer communication\n\n                LG-&gt;&gt;CommAgent: Draft approved customer communication\n                CommAgent--&gt;&gt;LG: Plain-language message\n\n                LG-&gt;&gt;Notify: Send approved communication\n                Notify--&gt;&gt;LG: Delivery status\n\n                LG-&gt;&gt;CaseSvc: Close / update case\n                CaseSvc-&gt;&gt;DB: Persist final decision + status\n\n                LG-&gt;&gt;Audit: Record closure + communication status\n\n                API--&gt;&gt;Portal: Case completed\n                Portal--&gt;&gt;Customer: Display final status\n            else Rejected\n                LG-&gt;&gt;CaseSvc: Update case outcome\n                CaseSvc-&gt;&gt;DB: Persist rejection / manual outcome\n                LG-&gt;&gt;Audit: Record rejection\n                API--&gt;&gt;Portal: Case routed for further handling\n            end\n        end\n    end&quot;,&#xa;  &quot;config&quot;: null&#xa;}" id="IwbSuFLQ5V0hhiv_ZeBH-1">
          <mxCell connectable="0" parent="1" style="group;transparentBounds=1;editIcon=1;lockedGroup=0;groupPadding=10;" vertex="1">
            <mxGeometry as="geometry" />
          </mxCell>
        </UserObject>
